 <#
 .SYNOPSIS

     FactoryTalk Logix Echo System Configuration Utility
     Copyright (C) 2021 Rockwell Automation Technologies, Inc. All rights reserved.

     This tool is intended to help system administrators to perform configuration tasks related to FT Logix Echo product installation and fix common problems.

 .DESCRIPTION

     This tool supports a number of operations that can be used to configure FT Logix Echo product installation:

         ConfigureDCOMPermissions

             This operation will configure DCOM ACL for Logix Designer COM services to allow download to be performed by FT Logix Echo Service. Implies FixLogixDesignerRegistry. This operation cannot be executed if Logix Designer is not installed.

         FixProgramDataPermissions

             Check if FT Logix Echo Service has access to shared application data folder and fix permissions if needed.

         FixLogixDesignerRegistry

             Fix invalid registry key created by LogixDesigner 33.00.00. This operation cannot be executed if Logix Designer is not installed.

     Note: It is recommended to restart the system after changing configuration using this tool.
